    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST AHIMR!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The most significant way to support development at this point is to wishlist &quot;<strong>A Hole in My Room</strong>&quot;. Help boost the game's visibility on Steam with just a click, it'll also ensure that you get notified as soon as we release. We appreciate your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/10dc43d325763b363cb11d0f3d9263f8.poster.avif?t=1751290484\" width=612 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/10dc43d325763b363cb11d0f3d9263f8.webm?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/10dc43d325763b363cb11d0f3d9263f8.mp4?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When I woke up, I noticed a strange hole in the ceiling of my room...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/acebad0174221906852b426bb398823c.avif?t=1751290484\" width=648 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is James. I don\u2019t know why I\u2019m here, nor do I know what\u2019s behind this door! I\u2019m trapped in a colorless space with strange lines an environment that resembles my room, except with a hole in the ceiling. A strange object covers the hole to keep the light from coming in. The only thing I know is that I\u2019m not alone here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/5dbb6c52e58d67eaec99e92aec30f27f.poster.avif?t=1751290484\" width=606 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/5dbb6c52e58d67eaec99e92aec30f27f.webm?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/5dbb6c52e58d67eaec99e92aec30f27f.mp4?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to experience a dark, intricate atmosphere? Explore strange, dark spaces, solve puzzles, and use different items to unlock doors. But remember, you\u2019re not alone! So, hide whenever you sense danger. Find a way out as quickly as possible, before the strange, dark creature finds you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/057e4365166a84151a8833deb569de49.poster.avif?t=1751290484\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/057e4365166a84151a8833deb569de49.webm?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/057e4365166a84151a8833deb569de49.mp4?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>A Hole in My Room</strong>&quot; is a Psychological Horror game currently in development across multiple chapters. In each chapter, players must solve unique puzzles, hide from lurking enemies, find hidden objects, and uncover the secret behind the game\u2019s story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/7fd7778463d441c514e84b34cca6b300.poster.avif?t=1751290484\" width=612 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/7fd7778463d441c514e84b34cca6b300.webm?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/7fd7778463d441c514e84b34cca6b300.mp4?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone, but who or what is looking \u00a0for you?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/79c8e0348ee35796fa3077380cb0f5b6.poster.avif?t=1751290484\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/79c8e0348ee35796fa3077380cb0f5b6.webm?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331450/extras/79c8e0348ee35796fa3077380cb0f5b6.mp4?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Chapter Features :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Duration: ~ 30min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover story of the first chapter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve some different puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Find hidden objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open locked doors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hide from enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoy the stylized graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
