team/apps/3331450/extras/79c8e0348ee35796fa3077380cb0f5b6.mp4?t=1751290484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Chapter Features :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Duration: ~ 30min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover story of the first chapter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve some different puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Find hidden objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open locked doors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hide from enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoy the stylized graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
